232
00:20:10,259 --> 00:20:11,160
Courtney?

233
00:20:13,495 --> 00:20:14,696
Court?

234
00:20:43,926 --> 00:20:45,493
Hey. O que está acontecendo?

235
00:20:45,627 --> 00:20:47,430
Houve um acidente.

236
